// render through it, so the orchestrator rethemes it and **this page neither uses nor edits
// it**. An "is it used?" check has to match the bare filename rather than the components/
// path, which is how a component reached only from another file got misread as inventory once.
// Every unused *Style / *Premium / *Cyber / *Huay / *CyberCut / *FloatingBadge sibling, the
// other Faq* and Announcement* files, the other LatestWinners* and the base ReviewCardSumo
// all stay on disk as inventory for the next brand — nothing was deleted, and the earlier
// brands' hues still inside them are expected drift.
//
// Ten widgets this template usually offers are deliberately absent, and they are named
// without their file extension on purpose because the playbook's "is this component live?"
// check is a bare-filename grep: ProviderGrid and ProviderGridPremium are out because this
// brief names NO game studio and NO operator at all, BankStrip is out as a page-level widget
// for the same reason on the banking side — **the brief says "ธนาคารและวอลเลท" and never
// names one bank** (FooterCyber still imports it, which is the orchestrator's file) —
// GameRankingBoard has no ranking to carry, SmoothCarousel has no brief section asking for a
