// ⚠️ The sky's pale blue, the foliage green, the outfits' cream, the lotus white and the
// lottery balls' black are OBJECTS IN THE PICTURE, not brand colours — none of them is
// allowed into the UI.
// ⚠️ The trap this round is RED, and it is a bad one: **red has led more brands through this
// repo than any other hue**, so finding "a red" in a file proves NOTHING — compare by VALUE.
// This round's crimson is #c30303 (R195 G3 B3), which sits **16 units** from รับตัง168's
// d30304 and **10 units** from สมหวัง168's b90203 — closer than this repo normally tolerates,
// accepted deliberately because #c30303 is logo.webp's own measured vivid. The separation
// this round comes from the blush-rose page (#ffdbdb, never used before), the antique-gold
// value and the full variant rotation — not from the red.
// ⚠️ **The antique gold #dcb95f / #b8862b / #96681f is a CHROME-ONLY colour and is NOT
// available to this page at all.** On a white card it measures 1.9–3.5:1, so none of the
